<title>SWITZERLAND: Sabena faces bad 1996, 1998 target ambitious.</title>
<headline>Sabena faces bad 1996, 1998 target ambitious.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paul Reutlinger, chief executive of Sabena, 49.5 percent owned by Swissair AG, said 1996 will financially be a bad year for the Belgian national carrier and the aim of making a profit in 1998 is &quot;very ambitious.&quot;</p>
</text>
